---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — NumForge"
  description="Terms and conditions for utilizing the NumForge digital electronics and number systems calculation platform."
  canonical="https://numforge.online/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0066cc] block">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-display font-semibold text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-[#1d1d1f] tracking-tight">
        Terms & Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#7a7a7a]">Effective Date: October 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[#333333] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-2xl text-[#1d1d1f]">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#333333]">
          By accessing or using NumForge (numforge.online), you agree to these Terms and Conditions and all applicable laws and standards.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-2xl text-[#1d1d1f]">2. Permitted Academic & Engineering Use</h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#333333]">
          NumForge provides number base conversion, digital logic synthesis, and binary arithmetic utilities free of charge for personal, educational, research, and professional engineering purposes. You may freely use results, formulas, and proofs in coursework, academic theses, and software development.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-2xl text-[#1d1d1f]">3. Mathematical Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#333333]">
          While NumForge takes extreme care to ensure mathematical correctness through unit testing against IEEE-754, ANSI, and ISO specifications, all tools are provided on an "AS IS" basis. NumForge cannot be held liable for discrepancies in life-critical medical, aerospace, or financial high-frequency applications.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-2xl text-[#1d1d1f]">4. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#333333]">
          For legal inquiries, contact: <a href="mailto:legal@numforge.online" class="text-[#0066cc] hover:underline font-mono">legal@numforge.online</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
